{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/d4d18b53eb6137d561e0942d05f46632.avif?t=1765001879\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300cMillennium Dream\u300dis a walking photography simulator built around the core of Chinese Dreamcore. You will lose yourself in meticulously crafted dreams of a bygone era...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting off in your bed on a lazy, sun-drenched afternoon; wandering the pedestrian street with your mom after school, the air filled with a faint, damp scent; or returning to the deserted campus, the place where you once &quot;battled&quot; day and night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can return, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Way Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything here is <strong>achingly familiar</strong>, just like your childhood home. And yet, it all feels so <strong>utterly alien</strong>... You suddenly realize... there's no one here anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/b50725112c4a23f49b513031dd5b0c47.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deserted Pedestrian Street</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like that evening all over again... you and your mom walking into the underground shopping center. The air is thick with the smell of dust, textiles, and dampness. Now, <strong>only silent mannequins</strong> stand guard over this forgotten corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/7f647116ad390e4b03fa1d9e082df8f4.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like that morning once more... sunlight streaming through the dusty windows. The blackboard still bears the faint traces of hasty chalk marks and faded doodles. But now, only <strong>empty desks and chairs</strong> sit in silence, waiting for students who will never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/01712e082e85bf82e61c96b7db9551b4.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Places</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the dreamscape. You might discover strange doorways... ...leading you back to a place you <strong>know intimately, but have never truly been</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/ed67ca29818c82d535a52f7a6192a2c5.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470560?t=1765001879","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3470560?t=1765001879","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/231f3007f9b0fc3b7eb24c47fabf14c328b8ec33/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765001879","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/231f3007f9b0fc3b7eb24c47fabf14c328b8ec33/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765001879","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/d4d18b53eb6137d561e0942d05f46632.avif?t=1765001879\" width=462 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u300cMillennium Dream\u300dis a walking photography simulator built around the core of Chinese Dreamcore. You will lose yourself in meticulously crafted dreams of a bygone era...</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drifting off in your bed on a lazy, sun-drenched afternoon; wandering the pedestrian street with your mom after school, the air filled with a faint, damp scent; or returning to the deserted campus, the place where you once &quot;battled&quot; day and night.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can return, but...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Way Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything here is <strong>achingly familiar</strong>, just like your childhood home. And yet, it all feels so <strong>utterly alien</strong>... You suddenly realize... there's no one here anymore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/b50725112c4a23f49b513031dd5b0c47.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deserted Pedestrian Street</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like that evening all over again... you and your mom walking into the underground shopping center. The air is thick with the smell of dust, textiles, and dampness. Now, <strong>only silent mannequins</strong> stand guard over this forgotten corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/7f647116ad390e4b03fa1d9e082df8f4.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to School</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It feels like that morning once more... sunlight streaming through the dusty windows. The blackboard still bears the faint traces of hasty chalk marks and faded doodles. But now, only <strong>empty desks and chairs</strong> sit in silence, waiting for students who will never come back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/01712e082e85bf82e61c96b7db9551b4.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hidden Places</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of the dreamscape. You might discover strange doorways... ...leading you back to a place you <strong>know intimately, but have never truly been</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/extras/ed67ca29818c82d535a52f7a6192a2c5.avif?t=1765001879\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","developers":["LucidDreamLab"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3470560/2fbb2892515aa4b1f24804af6e6ce389e5fca358/header.jpg?t=1765001879","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470560/880381/14e758825c2cf379ab2f0f358d5bf6c41fbd267c/1750853923/dash_av1.mpd?t=1745905651","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3470560/880381/14e75882